        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;Wed Nov 19, 7:30pm | Experience Leonard Cohen’s music like never before in this rich, multidisciplinary tribute from choreographer Idan Cohen and Ne. Sans Opera &amp; Dance. Blending live performance, contemporary dance, and stunning visual design, this evocative performance stars acclaimed Canadian bass-baritone Daniel Okulitch, lauded by Opera News as “flat-out brilliant,” alongside versatile dancer/musician [&hellip;]&lt;/p&gt;\\n"
