        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;Sat Jan 17, 7:30-pm | Metropolitan Opera star soprano Mireille Asselin and acclaimed baritone Jesse Blumberg lead Victoria Baroque on a tour through great love stories of ancient mythology brought to life by the music of Handel, Purcell, and Rameau, with exciting, newly-commissioned Canadian compositions. Founded in 2011 by Finnish-born baroque flutist Soile Stratkauskas, Victoria [&hellip;]&lt;/p&gt;\\n"
